ightPoint\" -> {\"ratio\" -> 2}, \"Droplines\" -> {\"freeformCursorMode\" -> True, \"placement\" -> {\"x\" -> \"All\", \"y\" -> \"None\"}}}}}, PlotRange -> {{5.830694649878444, 5.830951894845301}, {2., 2.0007498344068138}, {35.99850005006055, 36.}}, PlotRangePadding -> {Scaled[0.02], Scaled[0.02], Scaled[0.02]}, Ticks -> {Automatic, Automatic, Automatic}}]",
